<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Health cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Health cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said Friday it downgraded United HealthCare Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, United HealthCare reported disappointing earnings and said lagging margins in several markets would likely be a drag on earnings for the rest if the year.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/4 to 49-1/2.</p>
